          "type": "video",
          "url": "https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/Ij7v97NlYQz5t2Wx37TIbkbv7q-wrOEeD7KugoLDtppZpqBIbZ4vwrxDguSor-k4oQWb-wIR-9BqlThZxPfprdwHjyggbKhpJZzAL2XXGzDiWUX771Jh4Sk6oqYLR3kP-2A-UqdQu_uw5qhd7MkZh5obIkvoM6LTnXQAGUugwiMX7mPQDBaQpUMogE_NWZBp65WrLwBHRPlNxNe37Ufq4rGmyzVNpaFL4aeQcrgT-XTaEh3l3qwjiKkzYooeol553Bjvv3cXCOSITxXDYy_5UMaZid4uJX1K715s7N_6tZWA_mg2HBcp_2tKuCvULsqksygNavafuom7FsSD_OXqjg",
          "width": 640
        }
      ]
